Cell["\<\
As an example, the weights of the anti-fundamental representation of SU(3) \
are different depending on whether we specify the representation as CRep[{1, \
0}] or as {0, 1}:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1844091321,ExpressionUUID->"fb9db673-c928-4edb-b1fb-e7437587094f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
